            <ArticleTitle>[Case report: Seminal vesicle cyst with ipsilateral renal agenesis].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>619-20</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We describe a case of right seminal vesicle cyst with ipsilateral renal agenesis in a 25 year old male. The cyst caused severe pain syndrome with progressive perineal pain and pain on defecation and ejaculation. The cyst was surgically removed and the patient became asymtomatic.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
